# Cursor Rule — Design

Read `.ai/02-design.md` and `docs/DESIGN.md` before UI changes.

- Do not invent new visual patterns when an approved component exists.
- Design consistency > visual effects.
- Avoid gradients/animations/glassmorphism/shadows unless they serve a clear purpose.
- DESIGN LOCK: do not redesign the approved visual identity. You may improve accessibility, responsiveness, spacing, usability, performance, content clarity.
- Design for loading, empty, error, success, disabled, focus states.
- Mobile-first; stick to defined breakpoints.
- Target WCAG 2.2 AA (see `.ai/09-accessibility.md`).
